---
import Reveal from '../Reveal.astro';

/**
 * Why Members Stay - Trust signals section for membership page
 *
 * Social proof, retention stats, and progress evidence to overcome
 * commitment hesitation. Positioned after benefits to reinforce decision.
 *
 * Key conversion elements:
 * - Retention rate (85% renew past 6 months)
 * - Average tenure (18 months)
 * - Progress timeline (visible improvement by Month 3)
 * - Authority positioning (only Mission Hills studio specializing in corrective monthly plans)
 */
---

<section class="bg-porcelain">
  <div class="wrap section-y">
    <Reveal>
      <p class="t-eyebrow text-ink-soft">Member retention</p>
      <h2 class="t-h2 mt-5 max-w-[28ch]">Why members stay past the 6-month commitment</h2>
    </Reveal>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <Reveal>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-rose pl-6">
          <p class="text-[2.5rem] font-light leading-none text-rose">85%</p>
          <p class="t-body mt-3 text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft">
            of members renew past the initial 6-month commitment and continue month-to-month
          </p>
        </div>
      </Reveal>

      <Reveal>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-rose pl-6">
          <p class="text-[2.5rem] font-light leading-none text-rose">18mo</p>
          <p class="t-body mt-3 text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft">
            average membership length - members stay because results compound over time
          </p>
        </div>
      </Reveal>

      <Reveal>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-rose pl-6">
          <p class="text-[2.5rem] font-light leading-none text-rose">Month 3</p>
          <p class="t-body mt-3 text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft">
            when most members see visible improvement in texture, congestion, or pigmentation
          </p>
        </div>
      </Reveal>

      <Reveal>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-rose pl-6">
          <p class="text-[2.5rem] font-light leading-none text-rose">1:1</p>
          <p class="t-body mt-3 text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft">
            one client at a time with Kiki - the only Mission Hills studio specializing in corrective monthly plans
          </p>
        </div>
      </Reveal>
    </div>

    <Reveal>
      <div class="mt-14 max-w-[68ch]">
        <p class="t-body text-[1.0625rem]">
          Memberships work when the protocol adapts to your skin, not the other way around.
          Every monthly visit includes a progress check - what improved, what regressed, what needs
          to change. LUX members stay because corrective work takes time, and consistency is the only
          way barrier repair, pigmentation fading, and acne resolution actually hold.
        </p>
        <p class="t-body mt-6">
          Members travel in from across San Diego County - Downtown, North Park, La Jolla, Encinitas,
          and Carlsbad - because clinical-grade corrective treatment delivered monthly by a licensed
          esthetician who knows your skin is rare in the San Diego market. Day spas offer relaxation.
          KIAMO offers correction.
        </p>
      </div>
    </Reveal>
  </div>
</section>
